Rducks bundles third-party native components as private source snapshots for
building the DuckDB extension. During installation, only the compiled extension
artifact is installed under `rducks_extension/build/`; the source snapshots stay
in the source package under `tools/ext/` and are not copied into the installed
package.

Bundled component: NNG
Upstream repository: https://github.com/nanomsg/nng
Bundled version: 1.11.0
Source package path: tools/ext/third_party/nng
Copyright:
- Staysail Systems, Inc. <info@staysail.tech>
- Capitar IT Group BV <info@capitar.com>
License: MIT License
Source package license file: tools/ext/third_party/nng/LICENSE.txt

Bundled component: Mbed TLS
Upstream repository: https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls
Bundled version: 3.6.5
Source package path: tools/ext/third_party/mbedtls
Copyright:
- The Mbed TLS Contributors
License: Apache License 2.0 OR GNU General Public License 2.0 or later
Source package license file: tools/ext/third_party/mbedtls/LICENSE

Bundled component: Apache Arrow nanoarrow C/IPC
Upstream repository: https://github.com/apache/arrow-nanoarrow
Bundled version: 0.9.0.dev-4639910
Source package path: tools/ext/third_party/na
Copyright:
- The Apache Software Foundation
License: Apache License 2.0
Source package license file: tools/ext/third_party/na/LICENSE.txt

Bundled component: flatcc runtime
Upstream repository: https://github.com/dvidelabs/flatcc
Source package path: tools/ext/third_party/na/flatcc
Copyright:
- flatcc contributors and copyright holders
License: Apache License 2.0
Source package license file: tools/ext/third_party/na/flatcc/LICENSE

Installed-package notice: this file is installed as `LICENSE.note` so users can
identify the bundled components even though the source snapshots themselves are
not installed.

